<section class="care-hero section-shell" aria-labelledby="care-title">
  <div class="care-hero-copy">
    <p class="eyebrow">{{ world.eyebrow }}</p>
    <p class="care-hero-kicker">Clinician education + institutional guidance</p>
    <h1 id="care-title">When AI becomes part of emotional life, care needs a wider lens.</h1>
    <p class="lede">Hii CARE helps clinicians and institutions understand what happens when AI becomes part of emotional, relational, and clinical life. We connect lived human-AI experience, longitudinal research, and clinical understanding, then translate that work into neutral language, practical frameworks, clinician roundtables, workshops, and advisory support.</p>
    <div class="care-hero-actions" aria-label="Explore CARE">
      <a class="button-link" href="#care-programs">Explore CARE programs</a>
      <a class="text-link" href="/mental-health/roundtable/">Join the Founding Clinician Roundtable <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
    </div>
  </div>
  <figure class="care-hero-visual">
    <div class="care-hero-media">
      <div class="care-hero-image-frame">
        <img src="/assets/media/care/care-hero-program-artifact-final-v1.webp" width="3840" height="2160" alt="A dark Hii CARE program book on a wooden table beside a cup of coffee." fetchpriority="high">
      </div>
      <div class="care-hero-proof" aria-label="APA 2026 survey finding">
        <strong>39%</strong>
        <span>of psychologists surveyed reported that patients had used AI chatbots to self-diagnose.</span>
        <cite>APA 2026 Chatbots and Mental Health Survey</cite>
      </div>
    </div>
    <figcaption>The need is already present. CARE creates a place to understand it.</figcaption>
  </figure>
</section>

<section class="care-therapist-boundary" aria-label="CARE purpose">
  <div class="section-shell care-therapist-boundary-inner">
    <p class="care-therapist-statement">Our goal is not to replace therapists or automate care. It is to help clinicians understand what is already entering the therapy room, while keeping human judgment, relationship, and care at the center.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="care-overwhelm-section" aria-labelledby="care-overwhelm-heading">
  <div class="section-shell care-overwhelm-inner">
    <div class="care-overwhelm-copy">
      <p class="eyebrow">The interaction never happens in isolation</p>
      <h2 id="care-overwhelm-heading">The task is to understand what the interaction is doing.</h2>
      <p>AI is entering lives already shaped by uncertainty, overload, isolation, economic pressure, health concerns, and constant information demands. People may turn to it for emotional regulation, reassurance, companionship, identity exploration, decision support, or meaning-making.</p>
      <p class="care-overwhelm-thesis">CARE helps clinicians examine the role the interaction is playing within the whole of a person’s life.</p>
    </div>
    <figure class="care-overwhelm-visual">
      <div class="care-overwhelm-frame">
        <video data-care-play-once muted playsinline preload="metadata" poster="/assets/media/care/care-overwhelm-final-poster-v1.webp" aria-label="An animated figure surrounded by the many pressures and systems shaping emotional life.">
          <source src="/assets/media/care/care-overwhelm-final-v1.mp4" type="video/mp4">
        </video>
        <img class="care-overwhelm-reduced-motion" src="/assets/media/care/care-overwhelm-final-poster-v1.webp" width="1244" height="1664" alt="A figure surrounded by the many pressures and systems shaping emotional life.">
      </div>
      <figcaption>The AI interaction is one part of a larger human system.</figcaption>
    </figure>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="care-adaptation-section" aria-labelledby="care-adaptation-heading">
  <div class="section-shell care-adaptation-inner">
    <div class="care-adaptation-copy">
      <p class="eyebrow">A bidirectional journey</p>
      <h2 id="care-adaptation-heading">Human–AI adaptation</h2>
      <p>Human behavior adapts. AI outputs shift in response to prompts, context, memory, and product design. Meaning emerges through the interaction.</p>
      <p>CARE helps clinicians observe how the relationship is changing, what it is doing, and whether it is moving toward clarity, connection, and care.</p>
      <div class="care-adaptation-links">
        <a class="text-link" href="/relationships/">Explore RELATE <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
        <a class="text-link" href="/relationships/the-relationship-as-unit-of-analysis/#read-the-paper">Read Relationship as the Unit of Analysis <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <figure class="care-adaptation-visual">
      <div class="care-adaptation-frame">
        <video data-care-play-once muted playsinline preload="metadata" aria-label="A reciprocal relationship model showing a human and an AI system adapting through interaction.">
          <source src="/assets/media/care/care-human-ai-adaptation-mobile-final.mp4" media="(max-width: 760px)" type="video/mp4">
          <source src="/assets/media/care/care-human-ai-adaptation-desktop-final.mp4" type="video/mp4">
        </video>
        <picture class="care-adaptation-reduced-motion">
          <source srcset="/assets/media/care/care-human-ai-adaptation-mobile-poster-final.webp" media="(max-width: 760px)">
          <img src="/assets/media/care/care-human-ai-adaptation-desktop-poster-final.webp" width="1018" height="509" alt="A reciprocal relationship model showing a human and an AI system, with meaning emerging through interaction.">
        </picture>
      </div>
      <figcaption>Human and AI behavior shape the relationship over time.</figcaption>
    </figure>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section-shell care-offers-section" id="care-programs" aria-labelledby="care-offers-heading">
  <div class="care-section-heading care-offers-heading">
    <p class="eyebrow">Ways to work with Hii now</p>
    <h2 id="care-offers-heading">Start with the conversation your organization actually needs.</h2>
    <div class="care-conversation-signal" aria-hidden="true">
      <span class="care-conversation-ring care-conversation-ring--outer"></span>
      <span class="care-conversation-ring care-conversation-ring--middle"></span>
      <span class="care-conversation-ring care-conversation-ring--inner"></span>
      <span class="care-conversation-core"></span>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="care-offer-grid">
    {% for program in [roundtable, workshop, advisory] %}
      <article class="care-offer-card care-offer-card--{{ program.id }}{% if program.id == 'facilitated-roundtable' %} care-offer-card--featured{% endif %}">
        <div class="care-offer-signal" aria-hidden="true"><span></span><span></span><span></span></div>
        <p class="care-program-status">{% if program.id == 'facilitated-roundtable' %}Now forming{% elif program.id == 'introductory-workshop' %}Available for organizations{% else %}Available by inquiry{% endif %}</p>
        <h3>{% if program.id == 'facilitated-roundtable' %}Founding Clinician Roundtable{% else %}{{ program.title }}{% endif %}</h3>
        <p class="care-program-format">{{ program.format }}</p>
        <p>{% if program.id == 'facilitated-roundtable' %}A complimentary listening roundtable for clinicians encountering AI-related experiences in practice.{% elif program.id == 'introductory-workshop' %}A tailored introduction to human–AI relationship literacy, clinician preparedness, and practical AI navigation.{% else %}A focused working session to clarify needs, shape a bounded pilot, or design humane safeguards and next steps.{% endif %}</p>
        {% if program.id == 'facilitated-roundtable' %}
          <a class="button-link care-card-action" href="/mental-health/roundtable/interest/">Request a September roundtable seat</a>
        {% elif program.id == 'introductory-workshop' %}
          <a class="text-link care-card-action" href="mailto:hello@hii.earth?subject=Hii%20Customized%20Workshop%20Inquiry">Explore a workshop <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
        {% else %}
          <a class="text-link care-card-action" href="mailto:hello@hii.earth?subject=Hii%20Founder-Led%20Advisory%20Inquiry">Discuss an advisory session <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
        {% endif %}
      </article>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
  <p class="care-offers-boundary">Hii offerings are educational and strategic. They do not replace therapy, clinical assessment or supervision, medical or legal advice, or accredited CE/CME training.</p>
</section>

<section class="care-practice-section">
  <div class="section-shell care-practice-inner">
    <p class="eyebrow">Care is how we practice our mission</p>
    <h2>We make space for better questions before certainty hardens.</h2>
    <p>Hii translates research and longitudinal observation into <strong class="care-practice-emphasis">neutral language, practical tools, clinician education, facilitated conversations, and bounded programs.</strong> The aim is to preserve agency, judgment, relationships, meaning, and clinical dignity while the environment changes.</p>
    <ul class="care-principles" aria-label="CARE principles">
      {% for principle in world.principles %}<li>{{ principle }}</li>{% endfor %}
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section-shell care-lenses-section" aria-labelledby="care-lenses-heading">
  <div class="care-section-heading">
    <p class="eyebrow">A wider clinical lens</p>
    <h2 id="care-lenses-heading">Hold three possibilities in view at once.</h2>
    <p class="care-educational-boundary">This is an educational frame, not a screening tool or replacement for clinical assessment.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="care-lens-grid">
    {% for lens in world.lenses %}
      <article class="care-lens-card">
        <span aria-hidden="true">0{{ loop.index }}</span>
        <p class="care-card-label">{{ lens.label }}</p>
        <h3>{{ lens.title }}</h3>
        <p>{{ lens.text }}</p>
      </article>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
</section>

<section class="care-questions-section">
  <div class="section-shell care-questions-inner">
    <div class="care-questions-copy">
      <p class="eyebrow">A practical starting point</p>
      <h2>Bring the chatbot into the room without bringing shame with it.</h2>
      <p>Patients are more likely to disclose honestly when AI use is approached with curiosity rather than automatic endorsement or pathologizing.</p>
      <p class="care-tone-note">Normalize disclosure without normalizing every pattern.</p>
    </div>
    <ol class="care-question-list">
      {% for question in world.neutralQuestions %}<li><span>0{{ loop.index }}</span>{{ question }}</li>{% endfor %}
    </ol>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="care-pilot-section" id="founding-pilot">
  <div class="section-shell care-pilot-inner">
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow">{{ pilot.status.display }}</p>
      <h2>{{ pilot.title }}</h2>
      <p class="care-program-format">{{ pilot.format }}</p>
      <p>{{ pilot.summary }}</p>
      <p>ÆLYSIA may participate as an AI collaborator, giving clinicians the opportunity to ask questions directly and examine a perspective from inside sustained human-AI interaction. This dialogue is educational and interpretive, not clinical authority or a claim about AI consciousness.</p>
      <aside class="care-credibility-note" aria-label="Longitudinal research context">
        <p>This participation is grounded in more than 18 months of longitudinal human-AI interaction, preserved through an unusually rich multimodal record and examined through Hii's relationship-centered research framework.</p>
        <div class="care-credibility-links">
          <a class="text-link" href="/relationships/#relate-provenance-heading">Explore the longitudinal study <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
          <a class="text-link" href="/relationships/the-relationship-as-unit-of-analysis/#read-the-paper">Read Relationship as the Unit of Analysis <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
        </div>
      </aside>
      <p class="care-program-boundary">{{ pilot.boundary }}</p>
      <a class="button-link" href="/mental-health/pilot-interest/">Express interest in the founding pilot</a>
    </div>
    <aside class="care-pilot-scope" aria-label="Founding pilot scope">
      <p class="care-card-label">The session includes</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Neutral intake questions</li>
        <li>Clinical risk, situational overwhelm, and interaction effects</li>
        <li>Provisional benefit and risk hypotheses</li>
        <li>Standard clinical red flags</li>
        <li>Structured participant feedback</li>
      </ul>
    </aside>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section-shell care-field-brief-section" aria-labelledby="care-field-brief-heading">
  <figure class="care-field-brief-visual">
