    <h2 id="care-field-brief-heading">A Field Brief can follow a completed roundtable.</h2>
    <p>A future brief may preserve themes, questions, preliminary observations, practical language, and next steps from a facilitated conversation. It will be published only after the event occurs, the source boundary is clear, and participants understand how the synthesis will be used.</p>
